Description:It is your second main phase. You have Lightning Bolt and Shock in hand with two red mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life with 8 poison counters and controls Phyrexian Unlife (they don't lose for having 0 or less life; while at 0 or less, damage dealt to them is dealt as though its source had infect). Win the game this turn.
